{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_sub044_rocketchief_01",
      "hash": "97d6c0218d7a5e3f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "阿波羅「[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳是……"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_sub044_rocketchief_02",
      "hash": "97d6c1218d7a5ff2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "事到如今\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳還來這裡做什麼？\\c\\n都是因為[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳……\\n火箭隊解散了。"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_sub044_rocketchief_03",
      "hash": "97d6c2218d7a61a5",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "雖然我並不是個\\n感情用事的人……\\c\\n但就讓[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳\\n稍微體會一下我的感受吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_sub044_rocketchief_04",
      "hash": "97d6bb218d7a55c0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "………………\\c\\n算了。"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_sub044_rocketchief_05",
      "hash": "97d6bc218d7a5773",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "老實說……\\c\\n我的直覺告訴我\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳會來到這裡……\\c\\n所以剛剛正在給[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳寫信。"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_sub044_rocketchief_09",
      "hash": "97d6c8218d7a6bd7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我讀給[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳聽吧。"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_sub044_rocketchief_06",
      "hash": "97d6bd218d7a5926",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]\\c\\n恭喜[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳\\n稱霸了寶可夢聯盟。\\c\\n對於[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳對火箭隊的所作所為，\\n我並沒有懷恨在心。\\c\\n我反而會以此為力量，\\n建立更強大的火箭隊，\\r\\n然後終有一天，\\r\\n向全國宣佈我們復活的消息。\\c\\n雖然我會離開關都地區，\\n但請[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳在這個地方\\r\\n一直活躍下去吧。\\c\\n再見。\\n                          阿波羅"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_sub044_rocketchief_07",
      "hash": "97d6be218d7a5ad9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "阿波羅「寫這種東西，\\n我到底是希望\\r\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳對我有什麼想法啊……\\r\\n呵呵……"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_sub044_system_01",
      "hash": "9119a07e78e55947",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "阿波羅把信撕破了。"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_sub044_rocketchief_08",
      "hash": "97d6c7218d7a6a24",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……保重。"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_sub_event_044_max",
      "hash": "cc9ba4ed5e08b8e2"
    }
  ]
}
